# One whole checkpoint run for the About-offset measurement pre-registration
# (docs upgrade-gate/2026-09-10-w3-offset-measure-prereg.md §0/§1): a Device Portal ETW capture
# opened first (jobs/etw-1xD.env, TAG matches the smoke TAG so the three runs of the batch never
# overwrite each other's capture), the jobs/smoke-1x-D.env run inside it, then the read-only server
# snapshot, then the gather. Consumed by checkpoint.sh (run-scenario.sh checkpoint 1x-D <dated batch>).
ETW_JOB=1xD
SMOKE_JOB=1x-D
SNAPSHOT=1
SETTLE_SECONDS=10
BATCH=w3-offset-measure
